/*

Trainer parties for the developer-only Test Fixtures debug submenu
(src/test_fixtures.c, src/debug.c). Present in every build, same as
src/data/debug_trainers.party — only reachable through the R+START debug
menu (DEBUG_OVERWORLD_MENU), never from a map script.

These trainers use AI_FLAG_* purely by way of GetRulesetAiFlags() at battle
start (see DebugAction_Fixture_StartBattle in src/debug.c): no "AI:" line is
given here, so the authored flags are 0 and the only AI behavior in play is
whichever tier the RULES > AI Difficulty setting currently selects. That is
what lets the same fixture compare Standard/Improved/Expert/Pro Fair by just
changing the setting and re-running the fixture battle.

*/

